=== Keyboard Shortcuts ===
── Window and layout ──
  Ctrl+W w            Cycle the layouts: split, chat, list and focus
  Ctrl+W h            Show or hide the left panel
  Ctrl+W l            Show or hide the right panel; under 80 columns, open the
                      chat alone
  Esc                 Leaves the layout alone; to change it, use Ctrl+W w,
                      Ctrl+W h or Ctrl+W l
  Window only:
    Ctrl+W o/Ctrl+O   Put the chat over the video or beside it
    Ctrl+W x          Swap the sides of the list and the chat
    Alt+↑/Ctrl+W +    Increase overlay chat height
    Alt+↓/Ctrl+W -    Decrease overlay chat height
    Alt+PgUp          Make the chat background more opaque
    Alt+PgDn          Make the chat background more transparent
    Ctrl+→            Move the list divider to the right
    Ctrl+←            Move the list divider to the left
    Alt+←/Ctrl+W <    Move the chat divider to the left
    Alt+→/Ctrl+W >    Move the chat divider to the right
    Ctrl+B            Show or hide the list
── Settings ──
  Language: en · change it with --lang en or --lang pt-BR
